  "description": "A flustered ghost wrestles with a tangled orange sheet above bold Boo Sheet lettering. The orange-and-cream artwork brings a playful vintage look to Halloween gatherings and everyday spooky-season outfits.\n\nPRODUCT FEATURES\n\u2022 Gildan 5000 Heavy Cotton T-shirt\n\u2022 Classic unisex fit\n\u2022 White, 100% cotton\n\u2022 Medium-weight 180 g/m\u00b2 fabric\n\u2022 Tubular construction with no side seams\n\u2022 Ribbed knit collar and shoulder tape\n\u2022 Tear-away label\n\u2022 Sizes S\u20135XL\n\nFIT AND SIZING\nThis is a classic-fit shirt, not an oversized or boxy-fit tee. Please review the size chart before ordering. For a roomier fit, consider sizing up one size.\n\nCARE INSTRUCTIONS\n\u2022 Machine wash cold, maximum 30\u00b0C or 90\u00b0F\n\u2022 Tumble dry on low heat\n\u2022 Use non-chlorine bleach only when needed\n\u2022 Do not iron\n\u2022 Do not dry clean\n\nPRODUCTION\nEach shirt is printed to order. Slight variations in color and print placement may occur between the images shown and the finished garment. Designed by HomeFromWorking and professionally printed and shipped by a production partner.\n\nArtwork for this design was created with the assistance of an AI image-generation tool and arranged into the finished shirt design by HomeFromWorking.",
